%% Generic processing pipeline template
flowchart TD
    PIPELINE_START["PIPELINE_START\n(job/task trigger)"] --> STAGE1["Stage 1: ingest"]
    STAGE1 --> STAGE2["Stage 2: normalize/transform"]
    STAGE2 --> STAGE3["Stage 3: persist/index"]
    STAGE3 --> PIPELINE_DONE["Pipeline done"]

    STAGE1 --> FAILURE_BRANCH["Failure branch\n(log + status update)"]
    STAGE2 --> RETRY{"Retry needed?"}
    RETRY -->|yes| STAGE2
    RETRY -->|no| FAILURE_BRANCH

    CANCEL["Cancel signal (optional)"] --> CLEANUP["Cleanup/rollback"]
    CLEANUP --> FAILURE_BRANCH

